  "operation": "Recover every configured original ShadowBoneFollower subtree, retaining all GameObjects, Transforms, Sprite geometry, renderer fields and original follower settings. AttachmentFollower uses the migrated application implementation; the restricted shadow BoneFollower configuration uses independent Unity spatial math over live native bone ports. Rebind only the external skeleton pointer at runtime. Preserve native full-mip texture data and original Sprite vertices/UVs/pivot/rect; no replacement art or sampled follower positions."
